description:
An international preschool, playgroup program with fun-filled activities and thematic learning, Day care centre ,Music & Movement and many more programs are an integral part of our curriculum.

We believe that every child is unique and develops at his/her own pace. The age 0 to 6 years is the most impressionable age and we strive to:
1. Awaken children's spirit and imagination;
2. Encourage a child's normal desire for independence and a high sense of self-esteem;
3. Help children develop the kindness, courtesy, and self-discipline that will allow them to become a full member of society;
4. Help children learn how to observe, question, and explore ideas independently.
